#
# No Dockerfile here compiles anything from the context: Dockerfile.runtime only
# COPYs dist/<arch>/boat_gateway, and Dockerfile.build / Dockerfile.dev take the
# source as a bind mount. Without this file, every `docker build` shipped the
# whole build/ tree (gigabytes of FetchContent checkouts) to the daemon.
#
# Dockerfile.runtime also COPYs the legal files below. They live under
# boat-platform/ precisely because this is the build context, so they must be
# re-included after the catch-all above or the build fails on a missing file.
*
!dist/
!LICENSE
!NOTICE
!THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md
